+        
+        Changelog
+        =========
+        
+        v2.2.1 (2016-03-06) Tikitu de Jager
+        -----------------------------------
+        
+        - Fix #14: Infinite loop on `return x / 1;`
+        
+        v2.2.0 (2015-12-19) Tikitu de Jager
